{"data": [{"author_id": "911919195683643392", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120996367476641836"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 150, "start": 143, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 163, "start": 151, "tag": "BaseEditing"}, {"end": 170, "start": 164, "tag": "脂質異常症"}], "mentions": [{"end": 178, "id": "15862891", "start": 171, "username": "Nature"}], "urls": [{"description": "Nature - In Vivo CRISPR Base Editing of ANGPTL3 for Durable Lipid Lowering", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/s4158…", "end": 142, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11233-9", "start": 119, "status": 200, "title": "In Vivo CRISPR Base Editing of ANGPTL3 for Durable Lipid Lowering", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11233-9?error=cookies_not_supported&code=8a19d26e-606b-4331-8899-3dfdfdee4c81", "url": "https://t.co/dOKSPVFTL9"}]}, "id": "2120996367476641836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "In vivoでANGPTL3をCRISPR塩基編集し、脂質を持続的に低下させることに成功。1回投与で恒久的効果の可能性——コレステロール治療のパラダイムシフト。毎年飲む薬から「一生に一度の編集」へ。日本の製薬業界も無視できない転換点。 https://t.co/dOKSPVFTL9 #CRISPR #BaseEditing #脂質異常症 @Nature", "url": "https://x.com/keita_masui/status/2120996367476641836"}, {"author_id": "1928534969980432385", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:06:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120986589622911445"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/D3GPSxOnDP", "end": 225, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/rtfertility/status/2120986589622911445/video/1", "media_key": "7_2120986083785580545", "start": 202, "url": "https://t.co/D3GPSxOnDP"}]}, "id": "2120986589622911445", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your DNA has 3 billion letters. One wrong one can mean bad instructions for your cells.\n\nCRISPR is a find-and-replace tool for th